    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n73461" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁμήγῠρ-ις</span></b> , 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁμάγ</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-[ᾱ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ιος</span>, ἡ,</span> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄγυρις</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>assembly,
				meeting,</i> esp. of the gods, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεῶν μεθ᾽ ὁμήγυριν ἄλλων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					20.142
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>h.Ap.</u>
				187
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>h.Merc.</u>
				332
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hellanic.
				54
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁμάγυρις Ζηνός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>I.</u>
					7(6).46
				</span></i>
			 ; <i>any assembly, company,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γυναικῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ch.</u>
					10
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡλίκων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hipp.</u>
					1180
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄστρων . . νυκτέρων ὁ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					4
				</span></i>
			.</div>
